  "name": "Expense Completion Assistant",
  "description": "This agent interprets user instructions, updates the expense accordingly, checks the updates against policy rules, records any system recommendations, and summarizes all compliance issues or errors so the user can take the required corrective actions.",
  "specification": {
    "dataPipeline": {
